 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nSociété Lumière SARL\n12 Rue de la République, 69001 Lyon, France\nN° TVA: FR37 500882806\nReg No: FR-347497\n\nMASTER SERVICES\nAGREEMENT\n\nFROM\n\nSociété Lumière SARL\n\n12 Rue de la République\n69001 Lyon\nFrance\nVAT: FR37 500882806\n\nFACTURÉ À\n\nSociété Lumière SARL\n12 Rue de la République\n13001 Marseille\nFrance\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 16/03/2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and between Société Lumière\nSARL, with its registered office at 12 Rue de la République, Lyon (\"Party A\"), and Société Lumière SARL, with its registered office at 12\nRue de la République, Marseille (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 36 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in accordance with\nSection 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the purposes of this\nAgreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of England and Wales.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A    Société Lumière SARL / Pierre Martin\nParty B    Société Lumière SARL / Pierre Martin\nDate       16/03/2026",
